(7051986, 1072080, 19825, '<td valign="top">This may be my favorite. It has captured the beauty and grace of this small creature. This looks to me like it may have Wendy''s fingerprints all over it. If I am wrong you have done a great job. Wendy is not an easy one to imitate.</td>', 'This may be my favorite. It has captured the beauty and grace of this small creature. This looks to me like it may have Wendy''s fingerprints all over it. If I am wrong you have done a great job. Wendy is not an easy one to imitate.', '2013-06-13 18:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
