(7051993, 1071667, 19825, '<td valign="top">Love the graceful arcs, and this image is well suited for black and white. I have shot (and entered) similar scenes from a pool near my house. I wish they would put in a filtration system to clean the water for better photos. Nice job.</td>', 'Love the graceful arcs, and this image is well suited for black and white. I have shot (and entered) similar scenes from a pool near my house. I wish they would put in a filtration system to clean the water for better photos. Nice job.', '2013-06-13 18:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
