(7052387, 1072095, 115814, '<td valign="top">I don''t remember seeing anything like this POV/pose of a bird in flight. An interesting moment to capture. Among my top picks for this challenge.</td>', 'I don''t remember seeing anything like this POV/pose of a bird in flight. An interesting moment to capture. Among my top picks for this challenge.', '2013-06-14 19:17:09.000000', NULL, 0),
